<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_24/e_0022> <http://digistrucmed.org/spanConfidence> "0.94"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_24/tu_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "In patients with $K^+$ levels of $>6.5$ mEq/L on either maximal or sub-maximal tolerated, guideline-recommended target dose of RAAS inhibitor therapy, it is recommended to discontinue/reduce RAAS inhibitor. Treatment with a $K^+$ -lowering agent may be initiated as soon as $K^+$ levels $>5.0$ mEq/L. $K^+$ level should be closely monitored." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_24/e_0023/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
